<title>FRANCE: Algeria signs energy investment deal with Qatar.</title>
<headline>Algeria signs energy investment deal with Qatar.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Algeria and Qatar on Tuesday signed a protocol accord on investment and exchange of experts in the energy sector, the official Algerian news agency APS said.</p>
<p>Algeria's Energy and Mining Minister Amar Makhloufi, who signed the protocol with his Qatari counterpart Abdullah bin Hamed al-Attiyah, hailed the latter's visit to Algiers as &quot;a turning point&quot; in relations between the two Arab countries.</p>
<p>Algeria and Qatar struck a broad economic cooperation accord last October when President Liamine Zeroual visited the Gulf state.</p>
</text>
